{"3910510": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hopward", "steam_appid": 3910510, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                       <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910510/extras/9e537cdd8d63c3e7011a48cd36aea657.avif?t=1764345611\" width=432 height=115 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hopward is a vertical precision platformer set in a whimsical yet punishing world of pure vertical challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a determined little frog with one goal: <strong>reach the top</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with only a <strong>chargeable jump</strong> and a <strong>mid-air dive</strong>, you'll conquer a towering world of tricky platforms and mystical zones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No shortcuts. No checkpoints. <strong>No Autosaves—unless you earn them.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fall, learn, and hop again.</strong><br><strong>Each fall hurts. Each jump counts.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910510/extras/bf03563fdcceab685b7bcb7b82e49087.poster.avif?t=1764345611\" width=620 height=295 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910510/extras/bf03563fdcceab685b7bcb7b82e49087.webm?t=1764345611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>                        </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910510/extras/7eef69b6184d240346ba7dadc65e4979.avif?t=1764345611\" width=432 height=115 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold to charge, release to Hop. Your only tool is your jump and your own skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910510/extras/e2cc2444196a56f327cb6baf75590720.poster.avif?t=1764345611\" width=620 height=295 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910510/extras/e2cc2444196a56f327cb6baf75590720.webm?t=1764345611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                       <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910510/extras/c17aab6812eea56b63394093e738a687.avif?t=1764345611\" width=432 height=115 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start in a rainy pond, scale massive trees, brave arcane towers, bounce through beanstalks, and float among dreamy islands in the clouds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910510/extras/2f985260e533f2dadc6cae4ac537aef5.poster.avif?t=1764345611\" width=620 height=295 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910510/extras/2f985260e533f2dadc6cae4ac537aef5.webm?t=1764345611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                       <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910510/extras/50306c6e5571ddb7f2090ded17381e08.avif?t=1764345611\" width=432 height=115 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every slip can send you tumbling down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But falling isn’t failure—it’s part of the journey. Learn, adjust, and climb again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910510/extras/7dad5e0f2d730f99110b2d7554e8735f.poster.avif?t=1764345611\" width=620 height=295 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910510/extras/7dad5e0f2d730f99110b2d7554e8735f.webm?t=1764345611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                       <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910510/extras/9e537cdd8d63c3e7011a48cd36aea657.avif?t=1764345611\" width=432 height=115 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hopward is a vertical precision platformer set in a whimsical yet punishing world of pure vertical challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a determined little frog with one goal: <strong>reach the top</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with only a <strong>chargeable jump</strong> and a <strong>mid-air dive</strong>, you'll conquer a towering world of tricky platforms and mystical zones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No shortcuts. No checkpoints. <strong>No Autosaves—unless you earn them.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fall, learn, and hop again.</strong><br><strong>Each fall hurts. Each jump counts.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910510/extras/bf03563fdcceab685b7bcb7b82e49087.poster.avif?t=1764345611\" width=620 height=295 ><sou